sequenceDiagram
  actor U as Pengguna
  participant FE as React api.js
  participant API as Express
  participant DB as MySQL

  U->>FE: klik / submit
  FE->>API: fetch /api/mp/... + cookie
  API->>API: guard JWT + validasi
  API->>DB: SQL parameterized
  DB-->>API: rows
  API-->>FE: JSON ok true
  FE-->>U: render kartu / redirect
